# Line endings are load-bearing in this repo.
#
# main.ps1 and boot-main.ps1 are consumed through `powershell.exe -File` and through
# `irm | iex`, and the project treats a stray CR as a defect. Git stores them as LF
# already, but core.autocrlf=true (set in this working copy) rewrites the working tree
# to CRLF on every checkout. Pin it here so clones behave the same everywhere.
*.ps1    text eol=lf
*.md     text eol=lf
*.json   text eol=lf
*.toml   text eol=lf
*.drawio text eol=lf

# Never let git normalise these: a single byte swims out of place in a Windows
# shortcut or an archive.
*.lnk    binary
*.zip    binary
*.vdf    binary
*.png    binary
*.ico    binary
